      },
      "narrative": "After an otherwise timely and reasonable reinvestigation verified a disputed personal-loan item, the consumer filed a concise statement of dispute with the CRA. The CRA accepted the statement. Later reports that included the same item did not note that the item was disputed and did not include or summarize the consumer's statement. No reinsertion, reseller, or direct-furnisher dispute branch applies.\n",
      "provenance": "authored",
      "structured_fields": {},
      "title": "Consumer statement filed but later reports omit dispute notation"
    },
